          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best camping generator is the smallest, quietest inverter that covers the loads you will actually run. For most campers who cook electrically, that is a 2,000 to 2,500-watt inverter like the Honda EU2200i; for those who never do, a 1,000-watt unit or a power station is the better buy.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
